<title>UK: SBC ups bond exchangeable into drug firms basket.</title>
<headline>SBC ups bond exchangeable into drug firms basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp (Jersey) has increased its $200 million notes issue by $25 million, exchangeable into a basket of European life sciences stocks, sole manager SBC Warburg said on Friday.</p>
<p>The basket is made up of shares in Roche Holding AG, Novartis, Glaxo Wellcome, SmithKline Beecham and Zeneca Group Plc. All have equal weighting.</p>
